{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "權漢末魏初是白去也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "魏曹操等蜀劉備吳孫權等也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "晉書及傳云。父鳩摩羅炎。聰惠有大志節。將嗣相位乃辭避出家。東度葱嶺。龜茲王帛純聞其名郊迎之請為國師。\n王有妹年二十。方悟明敏。體有赤黶後生智子。諸國交嫂並不許之。及見炎心欲當之。王乃逼而妻焉。餘文大\n同也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "晉書云。光還至涼州。聞𮅟堅已死。為姚長所害。於是竊號河石也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今此非現在"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上兩釋配錄可知"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "述曰"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此即錄中所引也。意云。但說成所引聲為教體。不說成所引名等為體。故知位用聲為教\n體也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "性謂三性。種謂種子等。即界繫等。隨應者是不定義也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "述曰"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "餘二准說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "餘二准說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "餘二准說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "餘二准說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "並平聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "述曰為後成"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "述曰。此即長行不了應更頌釋也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "述曰。此即依請說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "述曰。此即因犯戒也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "述曰。此即因事說法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "述曰。唯為\n大乘極廣甚深"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無邊法門無有盡也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "果超眾聖非二乘及也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "經三無數劫長時修"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上論也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "奇寒反也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此部所計如錄所說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦如錄說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上十八有仙染鷄生子是此之族"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "多弘深義稍以大乘成實論等從此出也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "所計如錄"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云靈廟山也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "制多山西及北從此為名。此三皆部之所在"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "後根本四義根本五也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂因從居雪山從處為名也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上十人有仙染犢出子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有□可上故以為名焉也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂部主是賢徒胄胄者苗也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "刊正無語"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "山有密林部主居之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "部主曾化國已化行承出後捨出家\n從本為名也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慈恩云。是部主名福。先云是法名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上十八有仙身光捨成一。是此云同也。或云此\n部主身光飲餘光也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "立名依經故。又執有種子　墮在相續轉至\n後世故名說轉也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一列名。二辨相。三立。四指教。五本末。六同異。七了不了。八問答"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "述曰"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "重答三問"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上三論世親造"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無著造。無性菩薩及世親各造釋十卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云十支淄州沼法\n師造"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T54n2131_p1069a28"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf2", "text": "T55n2151_p0358c22"}
{"id": null, "n": "0056001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0056001", "type": "mod", "text": "部【大】，都【考偽-大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0058001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0058001", "type": "mod", "text": "心【大】，實心【考偽-大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0058002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0058002", "type": "mod", "text": "自【大】，同【考偽-大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0058003", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0058003", "type": "mod", "text": "同【大】，同一【考偽-大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0059001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0059001", "type": "mod", "text": "直【大】，憂【考偽-大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0059002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0059002", "type": "mod", "text": "希【大】，帝【考偽-大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0064001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0064001", "type": "mod", "text": "貝【大】，已【考偽-大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0064002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0064002", "type": "mod", "text": "落【大】，洛【考偽-大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0065001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0065001", "type": "mod", "text": "果【大】，乘【考偽-大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0066001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0066001", "type": "mod", "text": "朔【大】，飛【考偽-大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0052001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0052001", "type": "orig", "text": "【原】村山龍平氏藏燉煌本"}
{"id": null, "n": "0056001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0056001", "type": "orig", "text": "部＝都？"}
{"id": null, "n": "0058001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0058001", "type": "orig", "text": "（實）＋心？"}
{"id": null, "n": "0058002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0058002", "type": "orig", "text": "自＝同？"}
{"id": null, "n": "0058003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0058003", "type": "orig", "text": "同＋（一）？"}
{"id": null, "n": "0059001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0059001", "type": "orig", "text": "直＝憂？"}
{"id": null, "n": "0059002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0059002", "type": "orig", "text": "希＝帝？"}
{"id": null, "n": "0063001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0063001", "type": "orig", "text": "已下裏書"}
{"id": null, "n": "0064001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0064001", "type": "orig", "text": "貝＝已？"}
{"id": null, "n": "0064002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0064002", "type": "orig", "text": "落＝洛？"}
{"id": null, "n": "0065001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0065001", "type": "orig", "text": "果＝乘？"}
{"id": null, "n": "0066001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0066001", "type": "orig", "text": "朔＝飛？"}
{"id": null, "n": "0055b1401", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0055b1401", "type": "add", "text": "王【CB】，干【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0056a1801", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0056a1801", "type": "add", "text": "率【CB】，卒【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0062b2501", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0062b2501", "type": "add", "text": "胄胄【CB】，󱫶󱫶【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0064b1301", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0064b1301", "type": "add", "text": "刺【CB】，剌【大】"}
